      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just found out about this changes made in Build 1546 and this breaks existing functionality and pushes people to private instances.\n\nI often create public instances of random worlds and watch videos from my own server(s) or watch content I stream from my PC to my own server. \n\nI also run a purpose built server which allows me to use a single stream URL but have different content served to different people, none of the existing whitelisted services have functionality like this so I will be forced to use private instances for this now.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
